<p>Your stone spikes grow in length, instantly dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> Physical damage and disarming targets hit for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage increases with Spellpower and the chance to disarm increases with either Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.</p>